  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Grate carrot. Thinly slice spring onion. <br>• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm cubes. <br>• In a medium bowl, combine teriyaki seasoning and the plain flour. Add tofu and toss to coat. <br>• In a small bowl, combine the mayonnaise and Japanese-style dressing. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adeb84d22895b02ce5e5/step-accca200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• When oil is hot, cook tofu, turning until browned, 2-3 mins. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adeb84d22895b02ce5e5/step-d075b910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through. <br>• In a large bowl, combine shredded cabbage mix, carrot, Japanese-style mayo and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste and toss to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adeb84d22895b02ce5e5/step-b0f0a420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Build tacos by filling tortillas with slaw and tofu. <br>• Garnish with spring onion to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adeb84d22895b02ce5e5/step-33976930.jpg"
    }
  ]
